    "minDays and maxDays come from the FoodKeeper item named in \"foodkeeper\"; \"column\" is the FoodKeeper storage column used.",
    "The app computes expiry = simulated delivery date + maxDays.",
    "Where FoodKeeper has no entry for the ingredient, we use the closest FoodKeeper item and set \"proxy\" to that item.",
